{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    private static int solve(char[] s, char x) {\n        for (int i = 0; i < s.length; i++) {\n            if (s[i] == 'X') {\n                s[i] = x;\n            }\n        }\n        if (s[0] == '0') {\n            return 0;\n        }\n        int ans = 1;\n        boolean first = true;\n        for (int i = 0; i < s.length; i++) {\n            if (s[i] == '_') {\n                ans *= i == 0 ? 9 : 10;\n            } else if (s[i] == 'X' && first) {\n                ans *= i == 0 ? 9 : 10;\n                first = false;\n            }\n        }\n        return ans;\n    }\n\n    private static boolean canReplace(char[] s, char a, char b) {\n        if (s[s.length - 2] >= '0' && s[s.length - 2] <= '9' && s[s.length - 2] != a) {\n            return false;\n        }\n        if (s[s.length - 1] >= '0' && s[s.length - 1] <= '9' && s[s.length - 1] != b) {\n            return false;\n        }\n        if (s[s.length - 2] == 'X' && s[s.length - 1] == 'X' && a != b) {\n            return false;\n        }\n        return true;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        BufferedReader f = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        PrintWriter out = new PrintWriter(new BufferedWriter(new OutputStreamWriter(System.out)));\n        String line = f.readLine();\n        char[] s = line.toCharArray();\n        if (s.length < 2) {\n            out.println(s[0] == '0' || s[0] == '_' || s[0] == 'X' ? 1 : 0);\n        } else {\n            int ans = 0;\n            char[][] pairs = {{'0', '0'}, {'2', '5'}, {'5', '0'}, {'7', '5'}};\n            for (char[] pair : pairs) {\n                char a = pair[0];\n                char b = pair[1];\n                if (canReplace(s, a, b)) {\n                    char[] t = s.clone();\n                    t[t.length - 2] = a;\n                    t[t.length - 1] = b;\n                    if (s[s.length - 2] == 'X') {\n                        ans += solve(t, t[t.length - 2]);\n                    } else if (s[s.length - 1] == 'X') {\n                        ans += solve(t, t[t.length - 1]);\n                    } else {\n                        ans += solve(t, 'X');\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            out.println(ans);\n        }\n        f.close();\n        out.close();\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <vector>\n#include <algorithm>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nint solve(string s, char x) {\n    for (size_t i = 0; i < s.size(); ++i) {\n        if (s[i] == 'X') {\n            s[i] = x;\n        }\n    }\n    if (s[0] == '0') {\n        return 0;\n    }\n    int ans = 1;\n    bool first = true;\n    for (size_t i = 0; i < s.size(); ++i) {\n        if (s[i] == '_') {\n            ans *= (i == 0) ? 9 : 10;\n        } else if (s[i] == 'X' && first) {\n            ans *= (i == 0) ? 9 : 10;\n            first = false;\n        }\n    }\n    return ans;\n}\n\nbool canReplace(const string& s, char a, char b) {\n    size_t n = s.size();\n    if (s[n-2] >= '0' && s[n-2] <= '9' && s[n-2] != a) {\n        return false;\n    }\n    if (s[n-1] >= '0' && s[n-1] <= '9' && s[n-1] != b) {\n        return false;\n    }\n    if (s[n-2] == 'X' && s[n-1] == 'X' && a != b) {\n        return false;\n    }\n    return true;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    string line;\n    getline(cin, line);\n    string s = line;\n    if (s.size() < 2) {\n        cout << ((s[0] == '0' || s[0] == '_' || s[0] == 'X') ? 1 : 0) << endl;\n    } else {\n        int ans = 0;\n        vector<pair<char,char>> pairs = {{'0','0'}, {'2','5'}, {'5','0'}, {'7','5'}};\n        for (auto& p : pairs) {\n            char a = p.first;\n            char b = p.second;\n            if (canReplace(s, a, b)) {\n                string t = s;\n                size_t n = t.size();\n                t[n-2] = a;\n                t[n-1] = b;\n                if (s[n-2] == 'X') {\n                    ans += solve(t, t[n-2]);\n                } else if (s[n-1] == 'X') {\n                    ans += solve(t, t[n-1]);\n                } else {\n                    ans += solve(t, 'X');\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        cout << ans << endl;\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-1.5020257706055418e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0001454247540095821, -0.0002867764269467443, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -0.0007242917199619114, -8.940656698541716e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -3.933898824470816e-06, -4.60137271147687e-05, -1.0132738680113107e-05, 0.0, -0.0001934579631779343, -0.31327009201049805, -0.10020701587200165, 0.0, -0.038138724863529205, -0.04867884889245033, -0.003275388851761818, -2.264974000354414e-06, 0.0, -5.960462772236497e-07, -0.060457099229097366, -2.861018856492592e-06, -0.00010668662434909493, -0.005575344432145357, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -3.5762781180